{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ce5c5dc0-7961-8f16-a08c-6de733f4767c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T10:19:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Raj Nguyen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:15:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:15:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Before anything else, may I have your name again? I like to write it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:15:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's Kevin. K-E-V-I-N, Sousa, S-O-U-S-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:15:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kevin Sousa. Got it. Thank you. My name is Raj Nguyen. I'm calling about the plowing after the snow-to-rain storm that came in Sunday and wrapped up today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:16:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yep. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:16:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A city plow came down my street this morning and my car is plowed in. There's a wall of heavy snow along the curb, and my car is behind it. It's wet and packed, not light at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that stuff's like cement when it turns over to rain. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:16:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "25 Van Zandt Avenue. That's in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:16:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-five Van Zandt. Okay, I'm writing that down. And it's the plow bank at the end of your spot, or along the whole side of the car?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:16:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Along the whole side and across the back. I would have to dig out about eight feet of it, I'd say. I did start, but it's very heavy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:16:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So plowed in by the city plow, Van Zandt, car's boxed in at the curb. I'll put that in the log."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:17:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Also, I would like to ask for sand. The street is slick now. It rained on top of the packed snow and then the temperature dropped, so it's icy in front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:17:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that makes sense. I can put in a request for sand on that block. I can't tell you exactly when the truck gets there, they're working through the whole list today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:17:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Is it a truck that comes, or do I pick up sand somewhere myself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:17:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For the street itself it's the truck. I'll note the icy spot in front of twenty-five. If you want some for your own walkway, I can check on that and call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:17:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please do that. One moment, let me write that down. Check on sand for the walkway, call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:17:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Is this the best number? The one on my screen ends in oh-one-six-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:17:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is correct. 401-555-0161. It is my landline, so if I do not answer, please leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:18:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Now, about the car. I can't promise a plow comes back to clear the end of your spot, but I'll flag it so the crew supervisor sees it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:18:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is fine. I will keep digging in the meantime. I am not in a hurry to drive anywhere today. I do have a yard sale I plan to hold sometime in the spring, but that is a long way off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:18:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, well, plenty of time to get unburied before that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:18:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Now, to repeat what I have written. Car plowed in at 25 Van Zandt. Sand requested for the street. You will check on sand for my walkway and call me back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:18:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's exactly right. I've got it all in here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:18:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Does the request have a number, in case I need to call again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:18:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on, let me see. Okay, I'll give you a reference. It's the date and Van Zandt, so just say Monday, Van Zandt Avenue plow-in, and whoever picks up will find it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:19:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday, Van Zandt Avenue, plow-in. Written. Thank you, Mr. Sousa."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:19:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Mr. Nguyen. Take it easy shoveling, okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:19:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
